sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pegawai as "Pegawai"
    participant View as "Web View (employee.shift-swaps.create)"
    participant Controller as "Employee ShiftSwapController"
    participant Model as "ShiftSwapRequest Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Pegawai->>View: Isi formulir lalu klik Kirim Permintaan
    View->>Controller: POST /employee/shift-swaps
    Controller->>Controller: Validasi input + date rules
    Controller->>Model: createRequest(data)
    Model->>DB: INSERT shift_swap_requests + audit log
    DB-->>Model: Data permintaan tersimpan
    Model-->>Controller: Permintaan berhasil dibuat

    alt Data valid (shift, tanggal, dan aturan valid)
        Controller->>View: Redirect index + success
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi permintaan berhasil dibuat
    else Data tidak valid (validasi gagal / aturan waktu / bentrok jadwal)
        Controller->>View: Back + error
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi gagal membuat permintaan
    end
